WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.600
Welcome to the world of
The Pawsitive Pugs &amp; Pals.

2
00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:14.400
Our mission is to create calm, thoughtful,
educational content

3
00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:21.000
that helps young children explore the world

4
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:26.800
with curiosity, creativity
and emotional awareness.

5
00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:33.000
Our vision is to offer families
and educators

6
00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:40.760
a softer, more meaningful alternative
to over-stimulating children's media,

7
00:00:40.760 --> 00:00:50.040
where positive screen time supports learning,
connection and real-world growth.

8
00:00:50.040 --> 00:00:56.000
Join our pack and help shape
a world built around children,

9
00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:02.000
where the insight of parents, educators
and young minds guides everything we create.
